From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GWRT <gwrt@local>
Date: Tue, 4 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: drop IPQ6018 CP01-C1 reference board DTB

ipq6018-cp01-c1 is Qualcomm's IPQ6018 reference/EVK board, not a product
we ship, and "make dtbs" builds it unconditionally. It does not include
the UNIPHY PCS nodes that the ipq6018 GCC clock inputs reference, so it
fails phandle resolution and takes the whole qualcommax dtbs build with
it. Drop its DTB.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
@@ -20,7 +20,6 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq5332-rdp474.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq5332-rdp474.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq5424-rdp466.dtb
-dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq6018-cp01-c1.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq8074-hk01.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq8074-hk10-c1.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq8074-hk10-c2.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq9574-rdp418.dtb
